=== PROJECT: HOUSEHOLD GOODS E-COMMERCE STORE (DEMO BUILD) ===

SCOPE: Demo-ready storefront with a working mock payment flow that always
results in a successful transaction. Built for presentation purposes.
No real payment gateway integration required.


--- TECH STACK ---

Backend:
  - Django 5.x (Python)
  - SQLite3 (default Django DB — no setup, works fully offline)
  - Django ORM (no external ORM needed)
  - Django sessions for cart and auth state
  - Django's built-in auth system (no third-party auth package)

Frontend:
  - Vanilla HTML, CSS, JavaScript (no frameworks)
  - Tailwind CSS via CDN (play.tailwindcss.com CDN for zero-config setup)
  - Lucide icons via CDN
  - No npm, no build step, no bundler

Payments:
  - Mock payment handler — always returns success
  - Simulated 1.5s processing delay via JavaScript timeout
  - No real card validation, no external API calls

Media:
  - Static files served by Django (DEBUG=True for demo)
  - Placeholder product images from picsum.photos or local /static/img/

Deployment (demo only):
  - python manage.py runserver
  - SQLite3 file lives in project root (db.sqlite3)
  - No Vercel, no Supabase, no cloud required


